---

This work incorporates methodology from the following MIT-licensed projects.
Their original copyright notices are reproduced below.

### gstack — https://github.com/garrytan/gstack

Copyright (c) Garry Tan

MIT License. gstack defines a role-based engineering workflow (CEO, Eng Manager,
Designer, Reviewer, QA, Release Engineer) and a Think → Plan → Build → Review →
Test → Ship → Reflect sprint. Portions of this repository's workflow structure,
role definitions, and review dimensions are derived from gstack.

### superpowers — https://github.com/obra/superpowers

Copyright (c) Jesse Vincent

MIT License. superpowers defines a composable skill methodology including
brainstorming, writing-plans, test-driven-development, systematic-debugging,
subagent-driven-development, and verification-before-completion. Portions of
this repository's execution discipline are derived from superpowers.
